# What every one of reel's own demos shares: the look, the voice, and where the videos go. Each demo Imports it.

# The designed backdrop (demos/backgrounds), one for each shape a profile frames on: 9:16 for social, 1:1 for square,
# 16:9 for feed, and the window's own 16:10 for the rest. The intro and outro are reel's stings (design/motion), 9:16
# or 16:9; square has none, so its title cards go on the designed backgrounds.
Set Background social ? //demos/backgrounds/backdrop-9x16.jpg
    : square ? //demos/backgrounds/backdrop-1x1.jpg
    : feed ? //demos/backgrounds/backdrop-16x9.jpg
    : //demos/backgrounds/backdrop-16x10.jpg
Set IntroBackground social ? //design/motion/intro-reel-2s-9x16.mp4
    : square ? //demos/backgrounds/intro-1x1.jpg
    : //design/motion/intro-reel-2s-16x9.mp4
Set OutroBackground social ? //design/motion/outro-reel-2s-9x16.mp4
    : square ? //demos/backgrounds/outro-1x1.jpg
    : //design/motion/outro-reel-2s-16x9.mp4
Set Voice system
Set Ducking 30%
Set Subtitles on
Set ZoomEasing smooth
Set ZoomDuration 700ms
Set GifWidth 720
# Each Output once for each: musicbox-github.mp4, musicbox-social.mp4 (9:16, no GIF), and so on. See reel profiles.
Set Profiles github, web, social, feed, square
